        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Allen interval relation: a.end = b.start. Compares time:inXSDDateTimeStamp values directly; both intervals must have beginning/end timestamps with start &lt; end. Equal timestamps may belong to distinct instant individuals. No instant-to-instant ordering is materialized. Inverse relations are supplied by the retained OWL-Time inverse-property axioms.</rdfs:comment>
