        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">SWRL equivalent of the standard PROV-O property chain: qualifiedAssociation / agent implies wasAssociatedWith. Retains the lightweight PROV subset and makes qualified agent/role/plan associations usable without adding a PROV property-chain axiom.</rdfs:comment>
